# Line endings
# ------------
# Everything text is stored as LF in the repository and checked out as LF.
#
# This is written as `text eol=lf` rather than the usual `text=auto` on purpose:
# core.autocrlf=true is set system-wide here (C:/Program Files/Git/etc/gitconfig),
# so `text=auto` alone makes every checkout rewrite LF as CRLF and every editor
# re-warn about it. Attributes outrank core.autocrlf, so this rule wins.
* text eol=lf

# Data, trained artifacts and image assets are stored byte-for-byte and never
# converted - normalising a 15 MB CSV or a JPEG would corrupt them.
# These must come LAST: when a path matches several rules, the last one wins.
data/**              -text
models/**            -text
reports/figures/**   -text
app/assets/**        -text
